{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36968","headline":"龙泉东下却寄孙员外 · 罗隐","name":"龙泉东下却寄孙员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"縠江东下几多程，每泊孤舟即有情。\n山色已随游子远，水纹犹认主人清。\n恩如海岳何时报，恨似烟花触处生。\n百尺风帆两行泪，不堪回首望峥嵘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}